    "composite tenant-consistent foreign keys for operational relations",
    "unique visit per booking",
    "unique session_id plus ticket_number",
    "one called or in_service visit per doctor_id across sessions",
    "atomic capacity check and reserve with deterministic database locks",
    "events and outbox commit in the same transaction as the state change",
